  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The graph shows the variation with distance <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x\"></span> of the displacement of a string at a particular instant. The string is fixed at both ends and vibrates at its third harmonic with a frequency of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"50\\text{ Hz}\"></span>.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the speed of the transverse waves on the string?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"20\\text{ m s}^{-1}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"40\\text{ m s}^{-1}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"60\\text{ m s}^{-1}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"120\\text{ m s}^{-1}\"></span></p></li></ol>"
